      "severity": "high",
      "file": "src/navigation/index.tsx",
      "issue": "Bottom tab bar (`BottomTabBar` component) is not rendered or not reachable; the tab for \"Dashboard\" is missing in the UI hierarchy, causing the primary flow test to time out when trying to click the Dashboard tab.",
      "fix": "Add a `BottomNavigation` component with routes for Dashboard, Receipts, Mileage, Settings (and any other primary tabs) and ensure it is included in the root navigator. Verify that each tab has a visible label and icon, and that the component is rendered inside a `Screen` container so it stays fixed at the bottom on all platforms."
