      "issue": "Button style uses hard‑coded colors (`#0061A4`) instead of the theme tokens (`theme.colors.primary`).\n",
      "fix": "Replace any hard‑coded color values with `theme.colors.primary` and `theme.colors.onPrimary` via the Paper theme or style props."
